{"crc":"a32166af","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"The issue is that when using `TextChoices` or `IntegerChoices`, the field value is the enum member itself rather than its value. This happens because the enum's `__str__` method returns the enum member name instead of its value. The fix should be applied in the `ChoicesMeta` class to override the `__str__` method for enum members.\n\nLooking at the code, the best place to fix this is in `django/db/models/enums.py` by adding a `__str__` method to the `Choices` class that returns the value instead of the enum member name.\n\n# path: django/db/models/enums.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\nclass Choices(enum.Enum, metaclass=ChoicesMeta):\n    \"\"\"Class for creating enumerated choices.\"\"\"\n    pass\n=======\nclass Choices(enum.Enum, metaclass=ChoicesMeta):\n    \"\"\"Class for creating enumerated choices.\"\"\"\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return str(self.value)\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZQACS6CPZ12W2QN1PSTWEPF","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZQACS692QSDK9V45AH4WQRW"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786415311.970405}
{"crc":"c0695ce6","kind":"substrate.TriggerFired","payload":{"factory":"validator","firing_key":null,"input_sha256":"sha256:0709d8996fc5dfa4a7fb0867f63096eba3e234db2f089bf805546999ce409f45","instance":"01KZQACV3263EVZHGW3AFJBMBK","resolved_input":{"response":"The issue is that when using `TextChoices` or `IntegerChoices`, the field value is the enum member itself rather than its value. This happens because the enum's `__str__` method returns the enum member name instead of its value. The fix should be applied in the `ChoicesMeta` class to override the `__str__` method for enum members.\n\nLooking at the code, the best place to fix this is in `django/db/models/enums.py` by adding a `__str__` method to the `Choices` class that returns the value instead of the enum member name.\n\n# path: django/db/models/enums.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\nclass Choices(enum.Enum, metaclass=ChoicesMeta):\n    \"\"\"Class for creating enumerated choices.\"\"\"\n    pass\n=======\nclass Choices(enum.Enum, metaclass=ChoicesMeta):\n    \"\"\"Class for creating enumerated choices.\"\"\"\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return str(self.value)\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"trigger_id":"validate"},"producer":null,"schema":"substrate.TriggerFired@1","seq":15,"t":1786415311.970512}
